  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP for Gender Equality in Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN Joint Programme for Gender Equality promotes gender equality and women&#x2019;s empowerment in Georgia by strengthening the capacities of the Government at both the central and local levels across the executive, legislative and judicial branches, engaging civil society, and raising public awareness about gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
